        "jsCode": "// allow at most one command every 30 seconds\nconst s = $getWorkflowStaticData('global');   // memory that survives between runs (active workflow only)\nconst now = Date.now();                        // current time in ms\nif (s.last && now - s.last < 30000) return []; // too soon: stop silently\ns.last = now;                                  // remember this run\nreturn $input.all();                           // let the message through"
